issue_context.body:
### Describe the problem

My app contains a pyinstaller onefolder applicaiton as resource ,When I change build target from 'msi' to 'nsis', Build artifacts have become smaller，from 112MB to 70MB , but the installer decompression   slowly on client machine!


### Describe the solution you'd like

provide a option in tauri.conf.json as "nsis" chidren ,allow developer to set compressor to three kind;
https://nsis.sourceforge.io/Reference/SetCompressor
e.g:
{
  "tauri":{
      "bundle":{
          "windows":{
              "nsis":{"setCompressor":"zlib|bzip2|lzma"}              
}    
}
}
}

SetCompressor /SOLID zlib|bzip2|lzma

### Alternatives considered

_No response_

